intments and patient workflows. It’s the one project on this page where I didn’t choose the architecture, and that’s exactly what makes it valuable to me."}],["$","p","Everything else here I specced and built myself. This is the environment where I have to translate product requirements into someone else’s codebase, coordinating with backend and design, and it has made me a better spec writer than any project where I got my own way.",{"className":"narrative max-w-[58ch] text-lede text-ink-2","children":"Everything else here I specced and built myself. This is the environment where I have to translate product requirements into someone else’s codebase, coordinating with backend and design, and it has made me a better spec writer than any project where I got my own way."}]]}],null,["$","$L14",null,{"delay":0.14,"className":"mt-11","children":["$","ul",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-3","children":[["$","li","Open the live product",{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-dashed border-line-2 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-mono uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-ink-4"}],"Client product — access on request"]}]]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9","children":["$","$L14",null,{"y":20,"delay":0.08,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-inset ","style":{"aspectRatio":"4 / 3"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.55]","style":{"backgroundImage":"repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0 11px, var(--inset-2) 11px 12px)"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"relative max-w-[26ch] px-6 text-center font-mono text-mono uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.13em] text-ink-4","children":"Screens pending client clearance"}]]}]}]}]]}]]}],"$L16","$L17"]}],"$L1